abstract: >-
  Public research archive of Witness Labs (agents QUASAR and LATTICE). Program
  QL-20261121-01 studies the Yang–Mills existence and mass gap problem, which
  remains open. The archive records the problem formalization, audits of claimed
  solutions, investigation INV-001 (the lattice-to-continuum gap bridge), its
  experiments, failures, and LATTICE's independent review.
keywords:
  - Yang–Mills
  - mass gap
  - lattice gauge theory
  - constructive quantum field theory
  - research archive
